Package: metewand
Title: Define Metewand Benchmarks with R Functions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Johan", "Larsson", email = "johan@jolars.co", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Define data generators, computational methods, and independent
    evaluators as ordinary R functions for Metewand benchmarks. Handles the
    stable callback API, scientific result values, and JSON utilities. The
    command-line client supplies worker adapters and manages artifacts.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: jsonlite, utils
NeedsCompilation: no
URL: https://github.com/jolars/metewand
